{"screen_name": "180yen_Crepe", "file": "180yen_Crepe", "name": "180円", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1529825824274149376/oxUyn70o.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1529693422621052928/1653557849/1500x500", "description": "Name:180yen 自由に推したいものを描いたり呟いたり pixiv→http://pixiv.net/users/1820181 skeb→http://skeb.jp/@180yen_Crepe ご依頼ありがとうございます。納期ギリの場合はお手数をおかけします..!", "total_works": 14, "scraped_works": 14, "first_seen": "2026-03-20T08:42:35.157238+00:00", "last_updated": "2026-03-20T08:42:35.157238+00:00", "price_history": {"art": [{"amount": 4000, "recorded_at": "2026-03-20T08:42:35.157238+00:00"}]}, "current_prices": {"art": 4000}, "price_range": {"art": {"min": 4000, "max": 4000}}, "links": [{"label": "Twitter", "url": "https://x.com/180yen_Crepe", "name": "180yen_Crepe"}, {"label": "Pixiv", "url": "https://www.pixiv.net/users/1820181", "name": "1820181"}], "flags": {}, "acceptable": false, "works": [{"path": "/@180yen_Crepe/works/14", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/336d408d/uploads/origins/02180b86-d39a-45a2-95fd-6071eae1e5b9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=107fc85697afc6f4e3dffe59d73abc7c", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/336d408d/uploads/origins/02180b86-d39a-45a2-95fd-6071eae1e5b9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=107fc85697afc6f4e3dffe59d73abc7c, https://si.imgix.net/336d408d/uploads/origins/02180b86-d39a-45a2-95fd-6071eae1e5b9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c087f0f97f2f076532e79e3e4dd61cad 2x, https://si.imgix.net/336d408d/uploads/origins/02180b86-d39a-45a2-95fd-6071eae1e5b9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=806564698a7e26dbbc7609a453931e4b 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Please consider drawing Esme. She acts as a holy priestess during the day (brown eyes) and the kingpin of an underground syndicate at night (red eyes).  Feel free to draw her in any clothing you see fit. Her hairstyle also varies as she grows, a very simple twintail when she was young to the much more intricate swirls and braids as she got older. She keeps a snowmorph albino snake (up to you if you want to include the snake). Thank you so much for your consideration!\n\nhttps://toyhou.se/10172025.esmira/gallery", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@180yen_Crepe/works/13", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/8d9daa7e/uploads/origins/35510cab-868c-471c-957b-cf33751fbe11?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9e502b1cc35c799834297d95480fcb0a", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8d9daa7e/uploads/origins/35510cab-868c-471c-957b-cf33751fbe11?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9e502b1cc35c799834297d95480fcb0a, https://si.imgix.net/8d9daa7e/uploads/origins/35510cab-868c-471c-957b-cf33751fbe11?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a2413ef41bcf0ab1c0792f6a8aefc9d1 2x, https://si.imgix.net/8d9daa7e/uploads/origins/35510cab-868c-471c-957b-cf33751fbe11?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0d94e6c097d0856c448d16788fa16ab7 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは私はあなたのアートスタイルが好きで、私のFFXIVキャラクターのアートをお願いしたいです!\n猫の女の子で、ポーズや背景はお任せします！カッコよくて可愛い感じにしたいです。\nよろしくお願いします。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1r4kl6TJB0w-UeucwsojX5K_k_hR1ypsE?usp=sharing\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1r4kl6TJB0w-UeucwsojX5K_k_hR1ypsE?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@180yen_Crepe/works/12", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/979d6a62/uploads/origins/ceb06db9-334e-4e19-b2c7-2465dadb7d92?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=639e105d7e757ef520dea14d42e37435", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/979d6a62/uploads/origins/ceb06db9-334e-4e19-b2c7-2465dadb7d92?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=639e105d7e757ef520dea14d42e37435, https://si.imgix.net/979d6a62/uploads/origins/ceb06db9-334e-4e19-b2c7-2465dadb7d92?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b7aaa5ae6898de1412b9bc6488ccef2d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/979d6a62/uploads/origins/ceb06db9-334e-4e19-b2c7-2465dadb7d92?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c0a074e5f0fc64c85aa7d7fb117ab321 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "私のキャラクターを描いていただけませんか？\n\n彼女は宇宙を旅する泥棒です。胸と腕にある銀河の傷跡を隠すためにスカーフや包帯を巻いています。この傷のおかげで、有名な泥棒であることが一目瞭然です。\n\nペットのトカゲと一緒に、廃墟となった惑星のバンカーに潜んでいることが多い。仕事は危険だが、真面目な性格ではない。よく失敗をするが、とても楽観的な性格。\n\n世界のインスピレーション: https://www.pinterest.com/Sunny127501/world-moodboard/\n\nすべてのSNSで使えますか？\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/9JnbN5Y", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@180yen_Crepe/works/11", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/c3277a09/uploads/origins/e961cbcb-f596-4d3d-9ff0-3e0609c53b43?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0fb075b8643410582df4eb236078d68e", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c3277a09/uploads/origins/e961cbcb-f596-4d3d-9ff0-3e0609c53b43?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0fb075b8643410582df4eb236078d68e, https://si.imgix.net/c3277a09/uploads/origins/e961cbcb-f596-4d3d-9ff0-3e0609c53b43?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c0c0a7ad02a29227615555b788f7f3f4 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c3277a09/uploads/origins/e961cbcb-f596-4d3d-9ff0-3e0609c53b43?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9ab4d0e46c5a4d85629c364b397fd8d5 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Your style is incredible! I was hoping you would be willing to draw my FFXIV character. \nShe’s a tough woman and can come off as abrasive too strangers, but to her close friends she is reliable and fun. \nYou can draw her in whatever outfit you like the most!  You don’t have to draw the pets if you do not want. \nI will leave the pose and expression up to you. If you need a better reference of her face, you can use the very first image named Main Clothes. \nThank you for your consideration!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-BE1hTviHG0ymrXbnhA9HCVEobnQZma7", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@180yen_Crepe/works/10", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/f2258e29/uploads/origins/25bc4b8c-3405-42fe-9355-e61e455b2351?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f74f2555b520b3a6009f037412ee1956", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f2258e29/uploads/origins/25bc4b8c-3405-42fe-9355-e61e455b2351?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f74f2555b520b3a6009f037412ee1956, https://si.imgix.net/f2258e29/uploads/origins/25bc4b8c-3405-42fe-9355-e61e455b2351?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c5f8837099297d5c7e4663c6be844ab2 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f2258e29/uploads/origins/25bc4b8c-3405-42fe-9355-e61e455b2351?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cad60376dfcede3c1e729a75f0cf6313 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは。いつもお世話になっております。\nもしよければ、またイラストを依頼をしたいです。\n\n〇人物\nhttps://thup.work/miniup/?mode=edit&id=12035\n\n彼は手品師です。\nみんなの笑顔のためにという建前と、\n自身を認めてほしいという本音の中で偽りの自身を前面に出してステージに立ちます。\n\n〇構図\nポーズ、表情はお任せします。\n衣装の改変などもOKです。\n\n背景はもし描いて頂けるなら、簡単な感じでいいのでサーカス風の旗をイメージした感じがいいです。\n\nよろしくお願いいたします。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@180yen_Crepe/works/9", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/4cfbe964/uploads/origins/7137e1e5-cf2b-4787-bbd1-b5cf222d914b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=59bfc8af81f50cddc402b13df855d0c0", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4cfbe964/uploads/origins/7137e1e5-cf2b-4787-bbd1-b5cf222d914b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=59bfc8af81f50cddc402b13df855d0c0, https://si.imgix.net/4cfbe964/uploads/origins/7137e1e5-cf2b-4787-bbd1-b5cf222d914b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e1ca7bed6e087dec178bf90a20a0ab38 2x, https://si.imgix.net/4cfbe964/uploads/origins/7137e1e5-cf2b-4787-bbd1-b5cf222d914b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=df535d9093056a0c0526d733d761e1f8 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! I love your art style and coloring! I would like to request a illustration of Iekushi Chapipi. She is a bratty computer virus vtuber.\n\nCan you draw her in a pose and outfit similar to the reference image? Please give her a playful expression and do not include her headphones.\n\nCan Chapipi have permissions to use this for SNS (twitter, youtube, schedule, etc)? If this is not ok, please decline.\n\nThank you for your consideration.\n\nReference: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1cPNR53jPLa51M5eRYBBvUI1fdPz88Koq?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@180yen_Crepe/works/8", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/5e363349/uploads/origins/5cc51cb4-032a-47a5-bb4c-0e11fb82d8b3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d141029b71a8def167f0ff688dc441bb", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/5e363349/uploads/origins/5cc51cb4-032a-47a5-bb4c-0e11fb82d8b3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d141029b71a8def167f0ff688dc441bb, https://si.imgix.net/5e363349/uploads/origins/5cc51cb4-032a-47a5-bb4c-0e11fb82d8b3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0d542406fc2dfbbaa5e8510136f9dd83 2x, https://si.imgix.net/5e363349/uploads/origins/5cc51cb4-032a-47a5-bb4c-0e11fb82d8b3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bd5f6ba1dcd3eb7bc73455c7a2253c86 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんばんは\n氷沼悠理という子をお願い致します\nhttp://www.getchu.